.\" onvifsim 的 man page。选项列表要与 src/cli/CliOptions.cpp 里的 --help 保持一致。
.TH ONVIFSIM 1 "2026-09-11" "onvifsim" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
onvifsim \- ONVIF camera simulator with fault injection
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B onvifsim
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B onvifsim
.B \-\-headless
.RB [ \-\-scenario
.IR file ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B onvifsim
simulates ONVIF IP cameras for testing NVRs, VMS software, home\-automation
integrations and mobile clients. It implements WS\-Discovery, WS\-Security
authentication, RTSP streaming with embedded H.264 clips, JPEG snapshots, PTZ,
imaging, PullPoint events and two\-way audio (backchannel).
.PP
Every simulated camera can behave like a well\-mannered device or reproduce
real\-world firmware quirks on demand. See
.BR \-\-list\-quirks .
.PP
Run without arguments to get the graphical interface. With
.B \-\-headless
it runs without a GUI and exposes a REST control API, which is how it is
normally driven from CI.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-H ", " \-\-headless
Run without the graphical interface.
.TP
.BI \-\-scenario " file"
Load a scenario file describing cameras, quirks and network layout.
.TP
.BI \-\-cameras " n"
Create
.I n
cameras.
.TP
.BI \-\-preset " key"
Vendor persona for the created cameras. See
.BR \-\-list\-presets .
.TP
.BI \-\-bind " addr"
Listen address, default 0.0.0.0.
.TP
.BI \-\-http\-port " port"
First HTTP port, default 8000. Each camera takes the next one.
.TP
.BI \-\-rtsp\-port " port"
First RTSP port, default 8554.
.TP
.BI \-\-ip\-range " addr"
Give each camera its own IP starting at
.IR addr .
The aliases must already exist, or the process needs the privileges to add them.
.TP
.BI \-\-iface " name"
Network interface used for IP aliases and WS\-Discovery.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-discovery
Do not answer WS\-Discovery probes.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-control\-api
Do not start the REST control API.
.TP
.BI \-\-control\-port " port"
Control API port, default 9000.
.TP
.BI \-\-control\-bind " addr"
Control API listen address, default 127.0.0.1. Use 0.0.0.0 in containers.
.TP
.BI \-\-control\-token " token"
Require this token on the control API.
.B Strongly recommended
whenever the control API is reachable from anywhere but the loopback
interface: without a token every request is accepted.
.TP
.BI \-\-quirk " key" [= value ]
Enable one fault\-injection switch; may be repeated. Parameters use the form
.IR key . param = value ,
for example
.BR rtsp.max_sessions.max=1 .
.TP
.BI \-\-log\-file " path"
Also write the structured log to this file.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Include full protocol messages in the log.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-presets
List the vendor personas and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-quirks
List every fault\-injection switch and exit. Add
.B \-\-markdown
for Markdown output.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-scenarios
List the built\-in scenarios and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print a usage summary and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/onvifsim/scenarios/
Scenario files shipped with the package.
.TP
.I ~/.config/onvifsim/onvifsim.conf
GUI settings.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Eight Hikvision\-flavoured cameras, no GUI:
.PP
.RS
.EX
onvifsim \-\-headless \-\-cameras 8 \-\-preset hikvision
.EE
.RE
.PP
Reproduce a camera that drops 15% of its RTP packets:
.PP
.RS
.EX
onvifsim \-\-headless \-\-quirk rtsp.rtp_packet_loss.percent=15
.EE
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal termination.
.TP
.B 2
Bad command line, or the simulator could not start.
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation at
.UR https://github.com/mrtian2016/onvifsim
.UE .
